  "transform": "discard the wallpaper; sort rectangles by bbox area descending; rebuild each frame or solid rectangle, placing each next smaller rectangle at the lower-left of the current frame interior or solid bbox",
  "grid_shape": "crop to the largest foreground rectangle bbox"
}
</annotation>
